   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "heading": "Ups and downs notation",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Spoken as up, sharp, upsharp, etc. Note that up can be respelled as downsharp. The gamut runs D, ^D/vD#, D#, Eb, ^Eb/vE, E, ^E, vF, F etc."
  },
